==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 37.33~42.67 seconds<sup>1,120f~1,280f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 36.67~41.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,240f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dhalsim (Enemy)|Dhalsim]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 28~30 seconds<sup>840f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 36~40 seconds<sup>1,080f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The best optimal strategy is to use [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] and just rush the base to get the all the rewards.

